evidence = "The final hf-done JSON and private /out/run/gates.jsonl identify the exact verified revision, command, exit code and log path. Build and verification must pass on the same candidate revision. The runner computes that revision from the completed scoped files; embedding the content-derived candidate hash in this record would change it. The input and README revisions above identify the reviewed sources, not an unrun gate. The runner retains qualification evidence and publishes the result; no manual commit or push is performed."
